        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "A curse befell my crew, likely a witch\u2019s work. I\u2019ve been
          left no choice to venture forth to route the source, but it\u2019s been
          many moons since I\u2019ve ventured so far inland and I\u2019ve lost my- 
          ahem* become unfamiliar with the changed landscape."
